.serena/

# What a Paper server drops into whatever directory it is started from. scripts/live-server-test.sh
# boots into its own temporary directory and never leaves any of this behind, but a server started
# by hand from the repository root does — and `git add -A` then sweeps 90 MB of jars into a commit.
# That has happened once; these lines are so it cannot happen twice.
cache/
libraries/
versions/
logs/
plugins/
world/
world_nether/
world_the_end/
eula.txt
server.properties
paper.jar
banned-ips.json
banned-players.json
ops.json
whitelist.json
usercache.json
permissions.yml
bukkit.yml
spigot.yml
paper-global.yml
